Changes from 3.0.6 to 3.0.7
===========================

*Fixed:
- The search suggestions work again. They needed YUI 3, which ezjscore no longer ships, so no field showed
  any. ezajax_autocomplete.js is now plain JavaScript without a library, for the administration search box
  and search page, the site's search box and search page (ezwebin, ezdemo) and the ezflow search block.
- The administration search box (page_search.tpl) prints its suggestion script itself: it asked for it with
  ezscript_require() after the page head was out, so the script never reached the page.
- The AJAX search of the ezflow search block (ezajaxsearch.js) runs without YUI as well. The values the
  server returns are escaped before they go into the result, facet and spellcheck templates, the search
  posts its fields encoded, and several search blocks on one page keep their own settings.

*Updated:
- The suggestion list is an accessible combobox: the field has role="combobox", aria-expanded,
  aria-controls and aria-activedescendant, the list is a named listbox of options, and a status region
  announces how many suggestions there are ("%count suggestions" and "No suggestions", context
  extension/ezfind/autocomplete, translated in ger-DE). Down and Up move through the suggestions and wrap,
  Alt+Down opens the list, Enter takes the highlighted suggestion (without one it submits the search as
  before), Escape closes the list, a click takes a suggestion. The typed text is marked in each suggestion.
- Lookups wait for a pause in typing (250 ms, data-ezfind-autocomplete "delay"), only the answer to the
  latest lookup is shown, and answers are kept for the page. The server function and its URL are
  unchanged: ezjscore/call/ezfind::autocomplete::<text>::<limit>::<subtree>::<classes>.
- The list's look is in ezajax_autocomplete.css (classes ezfind-ac-*): the administration's tokens with
  their dark values in the administration designs, the site design's grey and white (with a dark variant)
  on the site. The yui3-* classes and the yui3-skin-sam wrappers are gone; a site that styled them needs
  the new class names.
- The facets of the AJAX search fade in by a CSS transition (ezfind.css, .ajax-search-facets.is-shown),
  without motion when the browser asks for reduced motion.
- The search tips of the search pages start hidden by the hidden attribute instead of an inline style.

*Removed:
- The templates no longer load ezjsc::yui3, ezjsc::yui3io, ezjsc::yui2 or ezjsc::jquery for the search.

Tests: tests/classes/ezfSearchScriptsTest.php (SS-01 to SS-04) runs tests/js/autocomplete.js (AC-01 to
AC-09) and tests/js/ajaxsearch.js (AS-01, AS-02) in node against a stubbed server function, and checks that
nothing in the extension refers to YUI; no database or Solr.
